//! # Responsibility
//!
//! This module is responsible for deterministic five-factor admission signals.
//!
//! ## Owns
//! - Utility, confidence, novelty, recency, and type-prior signal math
//! - The `factor_unavailable` error when a signal backend is down
//!
//! ## Does not own
